    "invoice that settles them (2), two payment appointment slips (3, 5) and",
    "the bank's cheque-delivery and pre-payment advices (6, 7).",
    "Only page 2 is covered by a requirement; every other block is scored over",
    "what its page states, and none of it is Mandatory."
